#N Snark
#O Mike Playle, 2013
#C A small stable reflector that turns a glider through 90 degrees and is
#C ready again after 43 ticks; shown with an incoming glider.
#C Verified by the Emergence Lab verifier (B3/S23, unbounded grid): reflects
#C incoming glider moving (-1, -1) into direction (-1, 1) and is restored.
#C Source: Life Lexicon Release 29, entry "Snark" (Playle's original, top of
#C the diagram); incoming glider taken from the same diagram's glider loop.
